# Style notes this repo writes on purpose, so `shellcheck` as in AGENTS.md's Verify exits 0 and CI
# (tests/ci.sh) can fail on anything new. Warnings and errors stay on.
#   SC2015  A && B || C: the shell idiom used throughout bin/ and tests/
#   SC2016  single quotes that hold jq, awk or stub-script text
#   SC2002  cat file | cmd
#   SC2012  ls instead of find, on test temp dirs with known names
#   SC2035  bare globs, on known file names
disable=SC2015,SC2016,SC2002,SC2012,SC2035
